ChunkVault is a fault-tolerant file storage system.
This file is being used to test file chunking.
We are making this for our pbl.
This is main chunking file.

ChunkVault is a fault-tolerant file storage system designed to store large files efficiently and reliably. The system divides a large file into multiple chunks and stores those chunks across different storage nodes. Each chunk can have one or more replicas so that the original data can still be recovered if a storage node fails.

